<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="h">JUD - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">JUD - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">JUD - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">JUD - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUD - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Mplɛ cɛr kǝŋe ire bǝn Yahuza, igen ayɔu Yesɔ Kristi, ben izumen ane Yakubu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Igar bǝn abaŋ ndi Arik ne zhɔ ba, abaŋ ndi ayime ne tanyɛme iye Arik Itetɛ bǝn ku ne angus akɛ Yesɔ Kristi:<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Mben te ilɔ susun, isik susun bǝn tanyɛme bɛ yi imin te shaga.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abɛ tsar mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Izhineba akpa amuŋ, Mne men wɔb te mbǝ ncɛr zhin ne atu ayi ta zhɔk mɔr bɔbɔk, Mne yik ne rɛ tem ncɛr te nek izhin lɛ te izhin bǝ tsi kli ne tanyɛme iyiŋ ndi Arik ne nek aneshir amaa mkpaŋ zhin. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Tǝ aner anuŋ abaŋ ndi ba ne zhi Arik ba ne mǝne tun ba ne min mɔr, aner ndi ne kyak lɛ kɛ ki didik ye Arik te abɛ akam agli ne nkuŋkɔŋ iyi na ki kiki mimin men, ndi ne kyak Yesɔ Kristi, Ŋgɔŋ amɔr zhin ndi wa ayi Ŋgɔŋ. Rɛ ikukub ilɛ kɛ Arik ne bla iyah iyiŋ ndi ne tei.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Mǝ wɔb te izhin bena shuzhi ne ir keŋ ndi Arik waŋ ndi ne ta aneshir ashur te gli ba arumɔ ne Masar, te ŋlɔk abaŋ ndi ne kyak tanyɛme bǝn abɔu. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Izhin bǝ zhi te abɛ shar ayɔu Arik abaŋ ndi ba ne gli ngɔŋ kɛ mgbyamgbyaŋ men ba te kyak sɔŋ ne amkpa amen: ne kpa ba ne atsǝtsaŋ te shur ba ne amkpa ne te ibu ngɔŋ yaŋ klɛtu, ne amkpa awaŋ ndi Arik aŋyak ba ŋub bɛr ngoŋ ndi atei te ba ŋas. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Shuzhi ntun yi Sodɔm bǝn yi Gomɔra, bǝn ntuntun yi nyaŋǝ, aneshire ne na ndi abɛ shar Arik ne na te nek atu amen ne iki yi abubu bǝn zǝ amba bǝn alulum, Arik ne gɔŋ ba ne lu kɛ yaŋ klɛtu.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa, aneshir abaŋa ne duŋ rimla men ne duŋ ba acɔk akpa amen ala, te kyak zǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik te yen Ŋgɔŋ ne shu. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Iwa ŋgɔŋ ne miŋ kɛ abɛ shar ayou Arik ine zhɔ te Makiel ne na amɛ, ne te antam maa bǝn shetan, ndi ne te atam te ai ŋɔwa atei baŋ kpa kɛ Musa, Makiel bane kyak ilɛ kɛ shetan ne taŋu tuk ba, ama adi, &lt;&lt;Arik abɛ tsaŋu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Ama aner abaŋa ne lɛ lǝlɛ mimin ne atu iki yiŋ ndi ba ne zhii ba; ben iki yiŋ ndi ne zhii ne alambur tu amen ayi ndi inarum gɔŋgɔŋ, aba ne gbur ilu aku atu amen. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Iya iyi men! ne zǝ nkɔŋ kɛ Keinu. Ne atu aye azɔb ne zǝr ahrie ne tsin cɔk ir keŋ ndi Balaam ne nama. Ne kyak wɔ lɛ ir keŋ ndi kɔra ne na, ndi wa ne zir ba. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Ne yaŋ shisha men aner abaŋa ayi aner amimin ne biŋ atu ayi nyɛr men ali kili bǝn abɛ zhin. Anaga kyu akpa men ankyak. Ayi ndi akpa ayi sha ndi nguŋgu yi yaŋ ku alu. Ayi ndi kuŋkun yi yaŋ dɔ ne kus, iyiŋ ndi ne kpɔbǝ ne ririn ma atyak ahrie te ku. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Ayi ndi ankun nǝk ndi ashak te ŋurɔka ne shisha men ndi ngluk. Ayi ndi icinces, yi klu gɔŋri iyiŋ ndi ne nai ne atu ayi ibu iyi yaŋ klɛ tu. <verse eid="JUD 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Ayi Anuhu wa, ayi ne taŋgba ibaŋ rɛ nŋli kɛ Ademu, ire kukub ne bla ilɛ ne atu amen: &lt;&lt;Arik atei nyɛ bǝn abɛ bla ishar tsetser amaa tetɛk <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />te abɛ te aneshir bɔbɔk ŋas, tena nek abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik ilalɛ men ne ankɔŋ ane yaŋ zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik, bǝn ililɛ mimin yiŋ ndi ne lɛ ne atu amaa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Aner abaŋa anaga lɛ mumur; tena nek akpa men ilalɛ; Atsǝn ne ankɔŋ yi na kiki yi nyɛr ne asusun amen te lɛ janjak ne kpa te bɛ yik iki iyi wɔb men.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igbaŋ atɔŋ bǝn inǝk lɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Ama shuzhi, akpa amuŋ, iki yiŋ ndi ane bla izhin kukub ne anu abɛ du lɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi amɔr. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Ne bla zhin te di, &lt;&lt;Ndi mkpaŋ kɛ klɛ tu te nyɛ, aneshir atei munɔru te mlak zhin, aner abaŋ ndi akyak zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik te zǝ ankɔŋ ane ikiki yi tik ayi men.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Waŋa ai aneshir abaŋ ndi aŋar aneshir, abaŋ ndi ikiki yi gɔŋmimi ibaŋ asusun amene, abɛ yaŋ Izhu Arik tsetser. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ama izhineba, akpa amuŋ, izhin bǝ flu ne tanyɛme iyi asusun amin tsetser, te ben zhin Arik ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Izhu tsetser, <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />izhin bǝ tsi kli ne nyɛr yi Arik, te ŋub nyɛ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi ne lɔ susun maa atei nek zhin vli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu. <verse eid="JUD 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Izhin bɛ lɔ susun ne atu abɛ yaŋ tanyɛme; <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Izhin bǝ yi abǝ gbur anuŋ gli rumɔ ne lu; bǝn anuŋ izhin bɛ lɔ susun mǝne ibiŋ ne sisik, ama izhin bǝ te shaan ne nkluŋklu men, ndi lalɛ bubu men ne cɔgǝ la.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ben yi gbar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Iwaŋ ndi ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ gli zhin te kǝr izhin bǝ zhaku ba tena nab zhin anǝk ne yaŋ lalɛ tena nyɛr ne ti kɛ ngɔŋ maa, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />bǝn Arik ne ta ta shur ankyak, ne ŋɔk kɛ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi, inǝk ŋgon, ilik gli ne shu, mgbyamgbyaŋ bǝn ngɔŋ, ire kuti te gar klɛtu! Ibǝ yi amɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>